text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1045" y="347" width="250" height="21.599999999999998" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n110" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;shape=note;size=18;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1330" y="349" width="300" height="125" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n111" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;① 요청 틀 (RequestFrame)&lt;br&gt;목표: 표 추가 + 메일 초안&lt;br&gt;표 / 보고서: 아직 미확정&lt;br&gt;관계: 보고서 결과 → 메일&lt;br&gt;조건: 메일 발송 금지&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1342" y="358" width="270" height="107.99999999999999" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n114" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1643" y="468" width="173.12" height="21.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n115" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;② 코드가 조회를 선택&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1645" y="469" width="195" height="19.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n118" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;shape=note;size=18;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1045" y="449" width="235" height="106" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n119" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;필요할 때만 부분 해석&lt;br&gt;모델에 특정 항목을 질문&lt;br&gt;예: 답변이 가리킨 업무&lt;br&gt;모델 결과 → 코드에 반환&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1057" y="458" width="205" height="81.6" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n120" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;shape=note;size=18;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1330" y="552" width="300" height="62" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n121" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;③ 항목을 코드로 해결&lt;br&gt;보고서: Task1 / Task2 → 질문&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1342" y="561" width="270" height="43.199999999999996" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n122" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1668" y="557" width="152.6" height="20.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n123" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;답변 뒤 Task1 연결&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1670" y="558" width="180" height="18.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n124" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1668" y="585" width="169.1" height="20.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n125" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;코드가 전체 의미 결합&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1670" y="586" width="180" height="18.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n129" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;shape=note;size=18;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1045" y="623" width="550" height="86" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n130" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;④ 코드가 만든 의미 제안 (MeaningProposal)&lt;br&gt;예산 보고서(Task1)에 선택한 표 추가&lt;br&gt;수정된 보고서 결과 → 메일 초안 / 메일 발송 금지&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1057" y="632" width="520" height="64.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n139" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1043" y="758" width="223.68" height="21.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n140" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;화면/대화 / 업무 기록 조회&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1045" y="759" width="260" height="19.2" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
